        "$\\int f^+=\\int_0^2 x\\,dx=2$；$\\int f^-=\\int_{-1}^0(-x)\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}$。（連續函數在閉區間上兩種積分相同，見〈Riemann 與 Lebesgue〉。）",
        "$\\int|f|=2+\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{5}{2}<\\infty$，所以 $f$ 可積，$\\int f=2-\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\int f^+=2$，$\\int f^-=\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\int f=\\frac{3}{2}$，$\\int|f|=\\frac{5}{2}$",
      "claim": "INT(x, 0, 2) == 2 ;; INT(-x, -1, 0) == 1/2 ;; INT(x, -1, 2) == 3/2 ;; INT(abs(x), -1, 2) == 5/2"
    },
    {
      "title": "瑕積分收斂，卻不是 Lebesgue 可積",
